# web: Doom in Mach compiled to WebAssembly (wasi-wasm32) for the browser
#
# Runs the same deterministic simulation, software renderer, status bar,
# automap, menus, character progression, saved games, lockstep multiplayer,
# sound mixer and OPL2 FM synthesizer as the native game. The browser host
# loads DOOM1.WAD into linear memory, calls web_init, drives the game at 35
# tics a second with web_tic, draws the 320x200 RGBA frame with web_draw,
# pulls 11025 Hz stereo 16-bit PCM audio from web_audio, and forwards MDR1
# relay packets through web_net_pop and web_net_push.

